WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:03.703
-Federal investigators executed
search warrants

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:05.705
at Rudy Giuliani's home
and office yesterday

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:07.773
and seized
his electronic devices,

00:00:07.773 --> 00:00:10.310
which, judging from
his public behavior,

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:12.479
may very well contain
lots of evidence.

00:00:12.479 --> 00:00:15.315
For more on this,
it's time for A Closer Look.

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:21.787
Oh, Rudy, sweet Rudy, we thought
you were gone from our lives

00:00:21.787 --> 00:00:23.355
once the Trump presidency
was over.

00:00:23.355 --> 00:00:25.157
But now, like a baby bird

00:00:25.157 --> 00:00:27.092
returning to its nest,
you're back.

00:00:27.092 --> 00:00:29.061
Although I guess Rudy
looks more like the egg

00:00:29.061 --> 00:00:31.931
before the bird hatches
or like a cartoon egg

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:34.200
where the legs hatch,
but that's it.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.169
Anyway, the point is,
Trump may be out of office,

00:00:36.169 --> 00:00:38.004
but the multiple criminal
investigations of him

00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:39.906
and his allies are
still very much ongoing.

00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:42.908
And yesterday, the feds provided
an emphatic reminder

00:00:42.908 --> 00:00:44.811
of that fact
when they executed multiple

00:00:44.811 --> 00:00:46.845
search warrants
at Rudy's home and office.

00:00:46.845 --> 00:00:49.048
-Now to a major development
in the federal criminal

00:00:49.048 --> 00:00:51.317
investigation
into Rudy Giuliani.

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:54.987
Yesterday, the FBI raided
his home and office in New York

00:00:54.987 --> 00:00:58.191
and seized cell phones
and other electronic devices.

00:00:58.191 --> 00:01:01.828
This investigation involves
the same U.S. attorney's office

00:01:01.828 --> 00:01:04.964
Giuliani used to run back
in the 1980s.

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:06.465
-The execution of
search warrants

00:01:06.465 --> 00:01:08.000
is an extraordinary action

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.170
for prosecutors
to take against a lawyer,

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:13.239
let alone a lawyer
for a former president.

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:14.674
The move marked
a major development

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:17.176
in the long-running
investigation into Mr. Giuliani,

00:01:17.176 --> 00:01:19.612
which examines some of
the same people and conduct

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:21.480
that were at the center
of Mr. Trump's

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:22.949
first impeachment trial.

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:24.851
-It's unusual,
to say the least,

00:01:24.851 --> 00:01:28.554
for prosecutors to execute
a search warrant on an attorney

00:01:28.554 --> 00:01:30.756
because theoretically
that could uncover

00:01:30.756 --> 00:01:32.992
privileged
attorney-client information.

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:34.761
-Something tells me this
is the first Rudy's

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:36.262
hearing of attorney-client
privilege.

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:38.531
He probably just thought
they meant it's a privilege

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:40.900
for an attorney
to actually have a client.

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:42.535
[ As Giuliani ] Honey,
someone finally hired me,

00:01:42.535 --> 00:01:44.403
put on your pearls
and your dancing shoes,

00:01:44.403 --> 00:01:47.907
going to Del Frisco's
where cousins eat free.

00:01:47.907 --> 00:01:50.943
[ Normal voice ] And, you know,
whatever they're looking for

00:01:50.943 --> 00:01:53.046
must be serious
if they're willing to execute

00:01:53.046 --> 00:01:54.713
a search warrant
against any lawyer,

00:01:54.713 --> 00:01:56.715
let alone
the president's lawyer,

00:01:56.715 --> 00:01:58.117
who's also a former mayor

00:01:58.117 --> 00:02:00.586
and the former head of the same
US attorney's office

00:02:00.586 --> 00:02:02.388
is now investigating,
which is crazy.

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:04.623
I'd be like
if I got canned.

00:02:04.623 --> 00:02:06.659
And then the show did
a closer look about me.

00:02:06.659 --> 00:02:09.795
I mean, I hope you guys
at least use a flattering photo

00:02:09.795 --> 00:02:11.530
for the over
the shoulder graphic.

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:18.004
Oh, come on! The one time
I sat on my own balls?

00:02:18.004 --> 00:02:21.774
Thanks, Lloyd.
And I know this is unlikely,

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:25.044
but I do hope they were able
to send at least one guy

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:27.046
to the raid who was
working there back

00:02:27.046 --> 00:02:29.348
when Rudy was in charge.
"Hey, boss, how you doing?

00:02:29.348 --> 00:02:31.617
You see that Yankee game,
last night?

00:02:31.617 --> 00:02:34.186
What do they
got holes in their bats?

00:02:34.186 --> 00:02:36.956
Yeah. Anyway, I got
to take your filing cabinet."

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:39.592
Also, these search warrants were
apparently a major operation

00:02:39.592 --> 00:02:41.260
as they were conducted
at multiple sites

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:43.229
against multiple people.
According to the<i> Times,</i>

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:45.798
FBI agents also executed
a search warrant

00:02:45.798 --> 00:02:48.267
on Wednesday morning
at the Washington area home

00:02:48.267 --> 00:02:51.437
of Victoria Toensing,
a lawyer close to Giuliani

00:02:51.437 --> 00:02:53.672
who had dealings
with several Ukrainians

00:02:53.672 --> 00:02:55.775
involved in the hunt
for information on the Bidens.

00:02:55.775 --> 00:02:58.311
Toensing is a fringe
right-wing figure,

00:02:58.311 --> 00:03:00.213
along with her husband,
Joe diGenova,

00:03:00.213 --> 00:03:02.048
a former "Fox News" crazy person

00:03:02.048 --> 00:03:03.816
who was also involved
in the Ukraine mess

00:03:03.816 --> 00:03:05.784
and is currently suing
Mike Lindell

00:03:05.784 --> 00:03:07.253
for jackin' his style.

00:03:07.253 --> 00:03:09.288
You guys remember this guy,
the guy who looks like he got

00:03:09.288 --> 00:03:11.457
put on a no fly list
or trying to sneak his own

00:03:11.457 --> 00:03:13.326
salami through security
at LaGuardia?

00:03:13.326 --> 00:03:16.595
"Hey, that's prescription
salami. I got low salt."

00:03:16.595 --> 00:03:18.798
What does this say about you
when these are your lawyers?

00:03:18.798 --> 00:03:20.332
They look like
the kind of guys

00:03:20.332 --> 00:03:23.068
who carry an extra neck
brace in their briefcase.

00:03:23.068 --> 00:03:24.971
"Here, put this on.
Judges can't resist them."

00:03:24.971 --> 00:03:26.906
Yeah, but it's
an embezzlement case.

00:03:26.906 --> 00:03:30.142
"Okay, you want to go to jail?
Be my guest."

00:03:30.142 --> 00:03:32.345
Rudy and Joe met when
they shared an office

00:03:32.345 --> 00:03:33.912
out of the trunk
of a taxi cab.

00:03:33.912 --> 00:03:37.183
"I got a big case, here,
help me move the spare."

00:03:39.251 --> 00:03:42.755
So there's a whole web
of weirdos involved in this.

00:03:42.755 --> 00:03:44.991
For the moment, the feds are
apparently homing in on Rudy.

00:03:44.991 --> 00:03:47.860
For one thing, they reportedly
seized his electronic devices,

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:49.261
which is no small thing,

00:03:49.261 --> 00:03:51.530
since he apparently has at least
three different cell phones

00:03:51.530 --> 00:03:53.199
and one iPad,
according to a reporter

00:03:53.199 --> 00:03:56.302
who profiled him for<i> New York</i>
magazine in 2019

00:03:56.302 --> 00:03:59.172
and one hand, he clutch
three phones of varying sizes.

00:03:59.172 --> 00:04:00.639
Two of the devices
were unlocked,

00:04:00.639 --> 00:04:02.341
their screens
revealing open tabs

00:04:02.341 --> 00:04:04.143
and a barrage
of banner notifications

00:04:04.143 --> 00:04:07.813
as they knocked into each other
and reacted to Giuliani's grip.

00:04:07.813 --> 00:04:09.716
"Do you have all three phones?"
his bodyguard said

00:04:09.716 --> 00:04:11.451
as Giuliani
stepped out of the car.

00:04:11.451 --> 00:04:13.119
"Yeah, I got all three phones,"
he said.

00:04:13.119 --> 00:04:15.888
"I got to get down to two.
I'm going to try that tonight."

00:04:15.888 --> 00:04:17.990
He did even better.
He got down to zero.

00:04:17.990 --> 00:04:19.858
Also, what do you mean
you have to get down

00:04:19.858 --> 00:04:21.127
from three phones to two?

00:04:21.127 --> 00:04:23.496
Does he think he has
to physically combine them?

00:04:23.496 --> 00:04:26.732
"I just need some duct tape."
Just stop using one of them.

00:04:26.732 --> 00:04:29.068
You know, you can sync all your
devices on the cloud. Right?

00:04:29.068 --> 00:04:31.670
Although I'm guessing the only
cloud Rudy's familiar with

00:04:31.670 --> 00:04:33.372
is the one that follows
him around all day,

00:04:33.372 --> 00:04:34.606
like Charlie Brown.

00:04:34.606 --> 00:04:36.976
Not only does Rudy
cycle through phones,

00:04:36.976 --> 00:04:38.544
he cycles through phone numbers,

00:04:38.544 --> 00:04:40.746
which has created
the bizarre situation

00:04:40.746 --> 00:04:43.349
of totally random people
inheriting his old phone numbers

00:04:43.349 --> 00:04:45.050
and getting weird calls
as a result.

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:47.353
According to reporters
who keep in touch with him,

00:04:47.353 --> 00:04:49.321
"He changes numbers
somewhat randomly,"

00:04:49.321 --> 00:04:50.790
one White House
reporter said.

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.458
"So you never really know
if you're texting

00:04:52.458 --> 00:04:53.992
the right number."
Personally, I have

00:04:53.992 --> 00:04:56.261
half a dozen numbers
for Giuliani saved.

00:04:56.261 --> 00:04:57.729
I just spoke to a man

00:04:57.729 --> 00:05:00.132
who has had one of Rudy's
old numbers for about a month.

00:05:00.132 --> 00:05:02.768
"Really?!" he said, when I told
him who used to have it.

00:05:02.768 --> 00:05:05.637
He added that it explained
the odd calls he's been getting.

00:05:05.637 --> 00:05:08.140
So some poor guy has probably
been getting inundated

00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:10.243
with phone calls
from Ukrainian mobsters,

00:05:10.243 --> 00:05:12.411
debt collectors,
and customer service

00:05:12.411 --> 00:05:14.413
at Ritz Crackers calling back
to let him know

00:05:14.413 --> 00:05:17.216
he can't book a three night stay
because they're not a hotel.

00:05:17.216 --> 00:05:19.685
Also, I'm surprised the feds
even had to raid his house.

00:05:19.685 --> 00:05:21.720
If they wanted the information
on his devices.

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:23.355
All they had to do
was watch "Fox News,"

00:05:23.355 --> 00:05:25.858
where he kept showing
off his phone and iPad

00:05:25.858 --> 00:05:27.960
and implicating various people
in his schemes

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:30.563
to dig up dirt on Biden
during the election.

00:05:30.563 --> 00:05:33.132
-I never talked to
a Ukrainian official

00:05:33.132 --> 00:05:34.700
until the State Department
called me

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:36.002
and asked me to do it.

00:05:36.002 --> 00:05:38.570
And then I reported
every conversation back to them.

00:05:38.570 --> 00:05:41.840
It's all here, right here.

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:43.676
The first call
from the State Department.

00:05:43.676 --> 00:05:46.079
Here's Kurt saying
"Great. I will tell Yermak

00:05:46.079 --> 00:05:48.080
and he'll visit with you there.
Thanks."

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:50.916
"Mr. Mayor, How was your meeting
with Andriy?

00:05:50.916 --> 00:05:55.087
Do you have time for a call?
Best Kurt."

00:05:55.087 --> 00:05:58.190
They're all over me
asking me to do it.

00:05:58.190 --> 00:06:00.092
I was happy to do it.

00:06:00.092 --> 00:06:01.361
-I guess Rudy is
one of those guys

00:06:01.361 --> 00:06:03.129
who lines up outside
the Apple store

00:06:03.129 --> 00:06:04.630
whenever their new product
comes out.

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:06.232
And how many bytes do you need?
[ As Giuliani ] None.

00:06:06.232 --> 00:06:08.567
If the feds come after me,
I could swallow it whole.

00:06:08.567 --> 00:06:10.703
[ Normal voice ] And how nice to
take a stroll down memory lane.

00:06:10.703 --> 00:06:12.972
Remember when the president
and his goons

00:06:12.972 --> 00:06:15.808
were so cartoonishly corrupt,
we all had to know names

00:06:15.808 --> 00:06:18.644
like your Yermak, Zelensky,
Parnas, and Frooman?

00:06:18.644 --> 00:06:20.079
Now the only
controversial name

00:06:20.079 --> 00:06:22.381
in the Biden administration
is Major.

00:06:22.381 --> 00:06:24.717
I'm pretty sure Yermak
was a Johnny Carson character.

00:06:24.717 --> 00:06:26.953
"Please welcome Yermak
the Magnificent

00:06:26.953 --> 00:06:29.689
all the way from Dijibouti.

00:06:29.689 --> 00:06:34.126
<i> Dijibouti,</i> which is also
the name of Gary Hart's yacht.

00:06:34.126 --> 00:06:38.731
-[ Laughs ] Yes.

00:06:44.302 --> 00:06:47.139
-You milked that so hard.

00:06:47.139 --> 00:06:49.242
I'm going to start
calling you YoYo Moo.

00:06:49.242 --> 00:06:52.278
-[ Laughs ]

00:06:52.278 --> 00:06:53.546
-So it's very possible
there's a ton

00:06:53.546 --> 00:06:55.047
of evidence
on those devices,

00:06:55.047 --> 00:06:57.450
especially when you consider
that an independent judge

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:59.418
had to sign off
on these warrants against

00:06:59.418 --> 00:07:02.354
such a high profile figure
the last time a raid like this

00:07:02.354 --> 00:07:03.855
happened to one of Trump's
ex-lawyers.

00:07:03.855 --> 00:07:05.824
The lawyer went to jail
and Trump was included

00:07:05.824 --> 00:07:08.326
as an unnamed coconspirator
in the indictment.

00:07:08.326 --> 00:07:11.297
And not only do we know
about the various communications

00:07:11.297 --> 00:07:13.132
Rudy bragged about
on television,

00:07:13.132 --> 00:07:16.035
we also know about his various
accidental communications,

00:07:16.035 --> 00:07:18.704
the ones that weren't supposed
to get out into the public.

00:07:18.704 --> 00:07:21.073
Like the time in 2019
he accidentally

00:07:21.073 --> 00:07:23.475
butt dialed
a reporter for "NBC News"

00:07:23.475 --> 00:07:25.377
and could be overheard
discussing various

00:07:25.377 --> 00:07:26.746
foreign countries

00:07:26.746 --> 00:07:29.549
he was entangled with
and a mysterious need for cash.

00:07:29.549 --> 00:07:31.183
-There's also some odd news

00:07:31.183 --> 00:07:34.554
today concerning this man,
Rudy Giuliani.

00:07:34.554 --> 00:07:36.689
There is no elegant way
to put this,

00:07:36.689 --> 00:07:40.359
but he butt dialed an "NBC News"
reporter last week,

00:07:40.359 --> 00:07:42.761
inadvertently leaving
a voicemail message

00:07:42.761 --> 00:07:45.097
that no one was supposed
to hear.

00:07:45.097 --> 00:07:48.734
-Tomorrow, I gotta get you to
get on Bahrain.

00:07:48.734 --> 00:07:51.336
You gotta call.

00:07:51.336 --> 00:07:52.839
You gotta call Robert again
tomorrow.

00:07:52.839 --> 00:07:55.875
Is Robert around?
-Rob, he's in Turkey.

00:07:55.875 --> 00:07:58.510
-The problem is we need
some money.

00:07:58.510 --> 00:08:00.646
We need a few hundred thousand.

00:08:00.646 --> 00:08:02.648
-Jesus, no wonder they never
asked Rudy to wear a wire.

00:08:02.648 --> 00:08:04.617
He is a wire.

00:08:04.617 --> 00:08:07.586
And look, I'm sure there's
a perfectly innocent explanation

00:08:07.586 --> 00:08:08.954
for why the president's lawyer,

00:08:08.954 --> 00:08:11.056
who spends all his time
cycling through phone numbers

00:08:11.056 --> 00:08:14.060
and jet setting across the world
with various unsavory characters

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:16.728
trying to manufacture dirt
on political opponents

00:08:16.728 --> 00:08:19.698
would mysteriously need
a few hundred thousand dollars.

00:08:19.698 --> 00:08:22.634
Maybe he needs it for
an emergency neck transplant.

00:08:22.634 --> 00:08:24.169
[ As Giuliani ]
They finally found me a donor.

00:08:24.169 --> 00:08:28.840
A giraffe at the Bronx Zoo
died of natural causes.

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:30.309
[ Normal voice ] And then, of
course, there was also the time

00:08:30.309 --> 00:08:33.379
he called Alabama
Senator Tommy Tuberville

00:08:33.379 --> 00:08:35.447
after a violent insurrection
at the Capitol

00:08:35.447 --> 00:08:37.383
to try to get Tuberville
to continue delaying

00:08:37.383 --> 00:08:38.818
the counting
of electoral votes.

00:08:38.818 --> 00:08:41.920
While Trump and Rudy figured out
a way to keep Trump in power.

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:43.388
-Senator Tuberville?

00:08:43.388 --> 00:08:44.823
Or I should say Coach
Tuberville.

00:08:44.823 --> 00:08:47.526
This is Rudy Giuliani,
the president's lawyer.

00:08:47.526 --> 00:08:52.398
There are 10 states that we
contest, not three.

00:08:52.398 --> 00:08:56.735
So if you could object
to every state and,

00:08:56.735 --> 00:09:00.106
along with a congressman,
get a hearings for every state,

00:09:00.106 --> 00:09:02.475
I know we would delay you a lot,

00:09:02.475 --> 00:09:03.843
but it would give us
the opportunity

00:09:03.843 --> 00:09:06.345
to get the legislators
who are very,

00:09:06.345 --> 00:09:08.714
very close
to pulling their vote.

00:09:08.714 --> 00:09:10.048
-Say what you want about Rudy,

00:09:10.048 --> 00:09:12.318
but I think it's nice
that he said Coach Tuberville.

00:09:12.318 --> 00:09:15.387
So Senator Tuberville heard it.
He knew Rudy was a friend.

00:09:15.387 --> 00:09:17.122
Of course, the problem
was Giuliani

00:09:17.122 --> 00:09:19.891
dialed the wrong number and left
a voicemail for another senator

00:09:19.891 --> 00:09:22.361
who in turn provided
the audio to the dispatch,

00:09:22.361 --> 00:09:25.197
which released the message,
"Senator Tuberville?

00:09:25.197 --> 00:09:28.501
or should I say Coach Tuberville
or should I say perfect stranger

00:09:28.501 --> 00:09:30.202
who is currently confused
by the message

00:09:30.202 --> 00:09:32.004
and who,
if they are polite,

00:09:32.004 --> 00:09:34.473
we'll stop listening now
and delete this message.

00:09:34.473 --> 00:09:36.842
And remember, these are just
the publicly available tests

00:09:36.842 --> 00:09:38.010
and phone calls
we know about.

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:39.344
Can you imagine
what else is on there?

00:09:39.344 --> 00:09:41.480
And apparently it's a lot
because the feds spent

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:43.349
a while carrying stuff
out of Rudy's apartment.

00:09:43.349 --> 00:09:45.350
How do we know that?
Not from the feds themselves

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:47.286
or even from the press
necessarily,

00:09:47.286 --> 00:09:48.621
but from one
of Rudy's neighbors,

00:09:48.621 --> 00:09:50.723
a tenant in his building
who spoke to the press

00:09:50.723 --> 00:09:53.358
and quickly became one of the
best parts of this whole saga.

00:09:53.358 --> 00:09:56.762
-I just saw people
I probably saw FBI jackets,

00:09:56.762 --> 00:09:59.965
but I just saw people, you know,
and I saw all of you.

00:09:59.965 --> 00:10:04.669
And and and I said.
"What is going on?"

00:10:04.669 --> 00:10:08.473
They're, probably maybe still up
there in his apartment.

00:10:08.473 --> 00:10:09.675
I really don't know.

00:10:09.675 --> 00:10:11.944
They were bringing out
a lot of stuff, right.

00:10:11.944 --> 00:10:15.881
The funniest thing is my
ex-husband called me and said,

00:10:15.881 --> 00:10:18.217
"Have you seen what's going on?"

00:10:18.217 --> 00:10:21.420
And I said he said,
"No, look out your window."

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:23.021
-Wow. It's not even
Saturday night.

00:10:23.021 --> 00:10:25.457
And Kate McKinnon is already
doing new characters.

00:10:25.457 --> 00:10:27.459
This lady's incredible.
What were they thinking?

00:10:27.459 --> 00:10:30.195
You can't just leave
a microphone unattended

00:10:30.195 --> 00:10:31.496
on the Upper East Side,

00:10:31.496 --> 00:10:33.265
otherwise the whole thing's
going to turn into

00:10:33.265 --> 00:10:35.234
a community board meeting,
instantly.

00:10:35.234 --> 00:10:37.470
[ As man ] I just want to say,
please don't put your hands

00:10:37.470 --> 00:10:39.971
inside the bins at Zabar's.
Use the scope.

00:10:39.971 --> 00:10:41.173
[ As Younger Man ] Yeah, hello.
I just want to say,

00:10:41.173 --> 00:10:42.941
if you're looking for a deal
on New Balance,

00:10:42.941 --> 00:10:44.943
come by my apartment.
I got a guy.

00:10:44.943 --> 00:10:46.278
[ As Elder Man ] Yeah. If you
people are going to keep

00:10:46.278 --> 00:10:48.147
bringing your dogs
on the elevator,

00:10:48.147 --> 00:10:50.649
wipe their paws, okay?
People live here.

00:10:50.649 --> 00:10:53.118
[ As woman ] Yeah, I know
the CDC said stop wearing masks,

00:10:53.118 --> 00:10:57.422
but if you've got coffee breath,
you know, keep it on.

00:10:57.422 --> 00:10:59.191
[ Normal voice ] Wouldn't be
surprised if during the raid

00:10:59.191 --> 00:11:01.794
there was a guy across
the hall in his pajamas.

00:11:01.794 --> 00:11:05.431
He had just eaten a bagel
bothering the agents.

00:11:05.431 --> 00:11:06.965
[ As Young Man ]
What are you guys doing?

00:11:06.965 --> 00:11:09.935
[ Normal voice ] Sir, this is a
law enforcement investigation.

00:11:09.935 --> 00:11:11.537
We can't comment.
[ As Young Man ] Okay, okay.

00:11:11.537 --> 00:11:14.807
Forget about it. You guys see
the Yankee game last night?

00:11:14.807 --> 00:11:16.108
What do they got holes
in their bats?

00:11:16.108 --> 00:11:19.778
Oh, you're taking the filing
cabinet? Interesting.

00:11:19.778 --> 00:11:22.414
[ Normal voice ]
Now, as for Rudy,

00:11:22.414 --> 00:11:24.083
he issued a statement
in which he claimed

00:11:24.083 --> 00:11:25.717
the Biden administration
was targeting him.

00:11:25.717 --> 00:11:27.919
And his son, Andrew, who worked
in the Trump administration,

00:11:27.919 --> 00:11:29.988
gave a press conference
defending his father.

00:11:29.988 --> 00:11:32.691
-Any American, whether
you were red or blue,

00:11:32.691 --> 00:11:36.561
should be extremely disturbed
by what happened here today,

00:11:36.561 --> 00:11:39.231
by the continued politicization

00:11:39.231 --> 00:11:41.199
of the Justice Department.

00:11:41.199 --> 00:11:43.802
If this can happen to
the former president's lawyer,

00:11:43.802 --> 00:11:45.838
this can happen
to any American.

00:11:45.838 --> 00:11:47.339
-Alright. First of all,
you look and sound

00:11:47.339 --> 00:11:49.975
like a character from a
mid-2000s Will Ferrell comedy.

00:11:49.975 --> 00:11:51.977
Who is your law partner?
Owen Wilson.

00:11:51.977 --> 00:11:53.178
[ AS Wilson ]
Hey, Andrew, do you know

00:11:53.178 --> 00:11:55.847
what habeas corpus means?

00:11:55.847 --> 00:11:58.684
Sounds like some sort of spell.

00:11:58.684 --> 00:12:03.022
[ Normal voice ] And yeah, we're
not doing Vince Vaughn today.

00:12:03.022 --> 00:12:06.358
I got your feedback
loud and clear.

00:12:06.358 --> 00:12:09.027
So now we can't have
nice things.

00:12:09.027 --> 00:12:10.529
Also what do you mean?

00:12:10.529 --> 00:12:13.865
If they can do this to Rudy,
they could do it to anyone.

00:12:13.865 --> 00:12:17.102
I'd be more worried that
if they couldn't do it to Rudy,

00:12:17.102 --> 00:12:18.470
they couldn't do it to anyone.

00:12:18.470 --> 00:12:20.372
Well, they couldn't
even get Rudy.

00:12:20.372 --> 00:12:22.040
Guess we live in a nation
without laws.

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:23.709
Isn't that the point, though,

00:12:23.709 --> 00:12:25.677
that no one is above the law
and the president's lawyer

00:12:25.677 --> 00:12:27.145
gets the same treatment
as everyone else?

00:12:27.145 --> 00:12:29.114
I never understood this
argument from Republicans.

00:12:29.114 --> 00:12:31.383
They said the same thing
during Trump's impeachment.

00:12:31.383 --> 00:12:32.885
If they can do this
to the president,

00:12:32.885 --> 00:12:35.887
they can do it to you.
Yeah, that's how it works.

00:12:35.887 --> 00:12:37.857
These guys are genuinely
shocked to find out

00:12:37.857 --> 00:12:40.092
that no one is above the law.
Oh, what's next?

00:12:40.092 --> 00:12:41.627
Is my father going to start
getting tickets

00:12:41.627 --> 00:12:43.496
for parking his car
on the BQE?

00:12:43.496 --> 00:12:47.532
Don't worry, I left the note.
Rudy has denied the allegations,

00:12:47.532 --> 00:12:49.501
so who knows what will
happen going forward.

00:12:49.501 --> 00:12:52.404
But it is obviously not a small
thing for the feds to decide

00:12:52.404 --> 00:12:54.606
there's enough evidence
to raid the home and office

00:12:54.606 --> 00:12:57.142
of one of the former
president's closest confidants.

00:12:57.142 --> 00:12:58.744
When the feds showed up
to Rudy's apartment

00:12:58.744 --> 00:13:00.545
to take his phone,
he was probably like --

00:13:00.545 --> 00:13:02.948
-It's all here.
Right here.

00:13:02.948 --> 00:13:04.950
-This has been A Closer Look.

00:13:08.587 --> 00:13:10.889
God's Love We Deliver cooks
and brings over two million

00:13:10.889 --> 00:13:12.591
meals a year
to men, women, and children

00:13:12.591 --> 00:13:15.961
living with HIV, AIDS, cancer
and other serious illnesses,

00:13:15.961 --> 00:13:17.462
and they need your help
now more than ever.

00:13:17.462 --> 00:13:19.564
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the donate button,

00:13:19.564 --> 00:13:23.235
stay safe, wear a mask,
get vaccinated, we love you.

